<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49117" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trĭmestris</span></b> , e, adj.
		ter-mensis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>of three months.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haedi,</span>”
				<i>three months old</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 3, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spatium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 10, 59, § 163</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anni Arcadum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					48, 49, § 155</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consul,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 80</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">satio,</span>”
				i. e. <i>that ripens in three months</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 4, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					9, 7</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">triticum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 7, 12, § 69</span></i>
			: aves, i. e. <i>that remain with us but three
				months</i>, 
			
			<i><span class="en">id. 10,
				25, 36, § 73</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annorum caelique vices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Edyll. 11, 24</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trĭme-strĭa</span></b> ,
			ĭum, n., <i>seeds
				that ripen three months after sowing</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 2, 12,
				9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 2,
			20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 26, 65, §
		240</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
